This is a main implementation for handlebars using my last commit main abstraction as reference.
I've basically used the same tests as you did and had to create some minor handlers for it.

Note: it is still missing the "set" and "trim" handlers. I have just created the "where"
Usage:

```
select i from TableC i
{{#where}}
   {{#if fieldA}}
       i.fieldA = :fieldA
   {{/if}}
   {{#if fieldB}}
       and i.fieldB like concat('%',:fieldB,'%')
   {{/if}}
   {{#if fieldCs}}
       and i.fieldC in :fieldCs
   {{/if}}
{{/where}}
``` 

In handlebars you can also replace the 

```
{{#if fieldA}}
       i.fieldA = :fieldA
{{/if}}
```

With simply:

```
{{#fieldA}}
    i.fieldA = :fieldA
{{/fieldA}}
```

